OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers fight to save pub oak
OL,4,Atree from the axe
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Broxtowe Borough Council issued a
OL,7,Fprovisional Tree Preservation Order on
OL,8,FTuesday, preventing the tree from being
OL,9,Ffelled without permission while its
OL,10,Ffuture is decided.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
